<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YUDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuda</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa iyi ikemelwa Yuda ikinyamula litawa lya yeasimbile baluwa iyi. Mwene Yuda ayitambuche kuva mwene ndi lukolo vake Yakobo na mkolo va Yesu. Suwe, Yuda ichelwa kuva ndi yumwi mugati lya vakolo va Yesu Yuda 1. Setuchela kuva baluwa iyi ngita ikali lya lipinga lya vanu vevamudikiye Kilisito litunga kuhumila na masimbo ga Lilagano lya dahila gye gasimbilwe umo vakwimba va kwanja yevakwimbile baluwa lya Yuda vakali Vayawudi. Ata nondee mwene asimbile baluwa iyi kwa vonda yevahaguliwe na kukelwa na Nguluvi Daada na kudimwa na Yesu Kilisito Yuda musitali va 1. Baluwa iwoneka ngita isimbilwe mumwaka lya sitini peababilwe suwe Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Natilo lya kusimba baluwa iyi kwa vanu yevamudikiye Kilisito ndi kuvalakilila vabihile kuyagichwa na mawulanichi gya udesi Yuda musitali va 4. Isimbila makani kuhuma Lyagano lya dahila neke kugangamicha makani ago gyeisimba. Baluwa iyi kuna mahocho myolofu kuhuma mu Peteli va uvili pamwi na lulakililo kutigila vawulanichi va udesi Yuda musitali va 4 na Peteli va uvili musula lya 2.1, ndeni ndeni iwonesa musitali kutigila makani ga vandumindumi na gyegakahumile mumwani va Sodoma na Gomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Yuda ivanga kwa kuvatambucha vakwimba baluwa lyake. Yuda musitali 1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele ilonga kwa liki asimbile baluwa iyi ambalyo nde kuvalakilila vanu ve vamuidikiye Kilisito vabihile kuvapulikla vawulanichi va udesi. Yuda musitali 3-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akuvagavila mufanu kuhuma kwa vanu na magito gyegagehe mulilagano lya dahila. Yuda musitali va 5-16.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele akavalongile kyevig'ang'a kugita kuhuma mumalakilolo. Yuda musitali va 17-23.</para>
  <para style="io">Mwiso imalila baluwa lyake kwa kumnjuma Nguluvi. Yuda musitali va 24-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Nene Yuda, mnyigendwa va Yesu Kilisito na mkolo va Yakobo, ndikuvasimbila nyenye yemuhaguliwe na kukelwa na Nguluvi Daada na kudimwa unofu na Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JUD 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Ndikumsuka Nguluvi avaongechele lusungu na lutengemaso na lukelo hilo.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vawulanichi va udesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Vakolo vangu yendivakeliye, ndikasakile ndivasimbiliye makani gya ulowolo vetuwanuke vonda, ila ndiwonile tandi inga'ng'wa ndivalakilile mwendelele kugangamala kumdikila Nguluvi yeavagitile mumudikile figono fyonda. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Ndikuvasimbilya Kwakuva kugehe vanu vangi sevakumdikila Nguluvi, vingiche kwa lupwepo na kwihanganya na nyenye. Vanu avo vigalambucha njowo cha Nguluvi vetu neke vagite sambi na kumkana Yesu Kilisito kilongosi mkomi, Mtwa vetu. Kuhuma daha isimbilwe kuva vanu avo davihigwa.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Nondee ndisaka kuvawiwusa nyenye, ata ngita mukalongilwe finu ifi, kuva Mtwa pevalowolwe vanu va Isilaeli na kuvahumicha muinyi lya Misili, ila pambele akavadocha vanu vonda vale sevamwidikile. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Na muweuke vandumindumi va Nguluvi vevayachiche mamulaka gyawo gya kutavala,. Vakalekile pono lyawo lya kkwikala. Ndeni Mtwa avavikile mukisi, vafopilwe kwa ndegei cha kyuma mbepali, vahigilwe mukigono kila kikomi. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Muwuwike vanu Sodoma na Gomola na vala va mwani cha pepi na vanu avo vakagitile ngita pevakagitile vala vandumindumi, vakagitile ugoni na kwidobokela sengita pevawumbilwe na Nguluvi, Nguluvi akavagavila lihigo lya kunyanywa lyoto va figono fyonda ngajila mwiso, neke gaveche malakililo kwa vanunvonda.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ata ndeni, vanu avo sevakumginya Nguluvi viwana na vawo, Vilota njosi, njosi icho chikuhafula mivili gyao vavene, vakuukana ukomi va Nguluvi na kufiliga fiwumbe fya Nguluvi fya ukoya kuluhano. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Ata Mikaeli, ndumindumi mkomi va Nguluvi, seakagitile ndeni pala pevalumbane na Setani kwakuva lya mvili va Musa. Mikaeli seakagechile kumuhiga Setani kwa madusi, ila akalongile, “Mtwa mwene akulakilile!” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ila vanu ava ulonga manjanganifu makani sevagachele, na mumakani gala gyevagichele ugita ngajila kuchela ngita vang'oko, kwakuva vang'oko vahela luhala na finu ifyo dafikuvahananga vavene. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Damulola nyenye! Vanu avo vafwatile kyanda yila yila lya Kaini. Kwakuva lya sendi vayingiche munongwa lilalila lya Balamu na vagalambuke ngita Kola na vahanangilwe ngita mwene pehanangilwe.<verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Vanu ava ndi vanjanganifu muluhungu chenu cha lukelo, vikela kulya vene ng'ani ngajila nyoni. Kangi nde ngita mafunde gyegihela ndonya gegipung'wa na lukala, maana lyake vihele undakyene mukwikala kwavo. Kangi ngita mibiki gegihela manunu chipindi cha mabenelo na gikulilwe gyonda na gigamile. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Vanu avo ndi ngita madaba makomi ga munyanza na magito gyawo ga nyoni gihuma ngita mafulofulo. Vene ndi ngita nondwa chechiyaga chechivikilwe mbepali pono pakisi ngomi.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enoki kilelo kya saba kuhuma Adamu, akahumiche uvichi kwa vanu ava, “Mulolele, Mtwa Nguluvi daikwika pamwi na maelufu lya vandumindumi vake, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />kuvahiga vanu vonda, na kuvatova vonda sevakumdikila Nguluvi kwakuva lya magito gyawo ma wofu vevagitile ngajila kumkela Nguluvi na kwakuva lya makani gyonda mawofu gya kumliga Nguluvi.” <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Vanu ava vakung'ung'ulika figono fyonda na kulonga uwafu kwa vanu vangi na kufwata ludobokelo chawo chiwofu na kuvanjuma vanu vangi neke vapatile finu kuhuma kwa vanu avo.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulakililo na malagicho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ila nyenye vaganja vangu, muwiwuke gala gemulongilwe pamwandi na vanjagila va Mtwa vetu Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Vakavalongile, “Figono kya mwiso, davahumila vanu davakuvabeda nyenye, vanu vevafwata ludobokelo chawo chiwofu.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Avo ndi vakuvanenga nyenye, vanu avo vihocha makani gya muinyi na vihela Muhe va Nguluvi.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ila nyenye vaganja vangu, mwime kwa ukangafu kwa kumdikila Nguluvi na kusuka mu Muhe vake, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />na mwendelele kukala mulukelo lwa Nguluvi, mukimuchindila Mtwa vetu Yesu kilisito na kwa lusungu lwake, davakuvagavila uwumi figono fyonda ngajila mwiso.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Muveche na lusungu kwa vanu sevaidikiye ndakyene, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />muvalowole kwa kuvahecha mulyoto. Ila kwa vangi muveche na lusungu na kwilolela, mukivipila ata mwenda chawo chechivikilwe uhafu na uvifi va ludobokelo chawo chihafu.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusuka na kunjuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Nguluvi nde mwene ludali lya kuvadima neke mubihile kuyaga, ila kuvasindika nyenye pautalo lya ukomi vake kangi ngajila unjanganifu kwa lukeduko mkomi. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Mwene ndi Nguluvi weka hela, Mulowa vetu kwang'asi lya Yesu Kilisito Mtwa vetu, njuma na ukomi na utavala na umwimike na ludali kuhuma inyi seukaumbilwe na nondee na figono fyonda ngajila mwiso! Ndakyene.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>